      "content": "idk i dont really have time to wait for a doctor appointment before my exams start. i just feel like my heart rate is usually fine on the ritalin by itself, so i doubt a little caffeine would do anything crazy. can u at least tell me like what's a safe amount of caffeine to take with it so i don't overdo it? just trying to find a balance.",
